// Ch13 B12 side scene (optional): "Someone Else's House" (E, 4 min, ~170 words). act2_ch13.md §4. Corran is
// spoken of in the past tense, as a man, not a Saint; no Archive talk; Ysolde cries at no point. She laughs,
// once, a real laugh: the first in the game (pillar 1: warmth that IS the grief, never undercutting it).
title: ch13_someone_elses_house
location: ch13/ansedra
---
// act2_ch13_direction.md: A15b is the street (lines 001-005, 009), A15 the locked front room with the scorch mark.
@camera A15b
@music silence fade=1.0
@anim ysolde look_at red_door
@wait 2.0
Ysolde [neutral]: That was our house. Corran's and mine. Eleven years. #line:ch13_house_side_001
@wait 1.5
Ysolde [neutral]: The Order gave it to a Tender's family when he was raised. They have painted the door. #line:ch13_house_side_002
Rhen [neutral]: Do you want to go in? #line:ch13_house_side_003
Ysolde [cold]: No. #line:ch13_house_side_004
@wait 2.0
Ysolde [sad]: Yes. #line:ch13_house_side_005
@anim rhen knock red_door
@mark householder door walk
@anim householder bow ysolde
@wait 2.0
@mark ysolde front_room walk
@mark rhen front_room_b walk
@camera A15
@anim ysolde look_at scorch_mark
@wait 3.0
Ysolde [soft_smile]: He was a terrible cook. That is from a fish. #line:ch13_house_side_006
@anim rhen laugh
@anim ysolde laugh
@wait 2.0
Householder as "The householder" [worried]: Should we paint over it again, Mistress? #line:ch13_house_side_007
Ysolde [tender]: No. Please. Leave it. #line:ch13_house_side_008
@camera A15b
@mark ysolde street walk
@mark rhen street_b walk
@wait 2.0
Ysolde [soft_smile]: Thank you, Master Sallow. I have decided to notice. #line:ch13_house_side_009
<<set $ch13_corran_house = true>>
@music ansedra fade=3.0
===
